  "preamble": "Voicing of the voiceless alveolo-palatal affricate [tɕ] to its voiced counterpart [dʑ] keeps place and manner and adds vocal-fold vibration in a voiced environment. Korean voices lax /tɕ/ (ㅈ) to [dʑ] between sonorants, and Polish ć [tɕ] becomes [dʑ] by regressive voicing assimilation before a voiced obstruent, as in pięćdziesiąt 'fifty'.",
